  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyPolicyBody": "Skyde is a personal weather and daily planning assistant.\n\nData we collect\n• Location: Only while the app is open or for saved locations you choose.\n• Name & preferences: Stored locally on your device (mode, notifications, language).\n• Saved places & plans: Local storage on your device.\n• Notifications: Local alerts and optional Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM) token.\n\nData sharing\n• Weather data comes from the Open-Meteo API; coordinates are sent to this service.\n• Your data is not sold to third parties.\n\nRetention\n• Preferences and cache stay on your device. Uninstalling removes local data.\n\nYour rights\n• You can turn off notifications and location in Settings.\n• Questions: support@skyde.app\n\nLast updated: March 2026"
